# Booking, webhooks, audit

WhatsApp and Paystack webhooks are the source of truth. Ack fast, enqueue work. Do not poll payment or delivery state.

## Booking states

Only the Paystack webhook handler may move a booking to **confirmed**. Conversation code may initialize payment and talk about **processing**.

Physio accept/decline and slot holds must not skip the payment confirmation rule.

## Audit

Append-only. Independently queryable. At minimum log:

- triage outcome / progress
- safety evaluator result
- match ranking + chosen specialty
- payout / referral-fee decisions

Do not update audit rows in place. Insert new events.

## Internal APIs

`api/internal/*` exists so Retool, physio dashboard, partner portal, and receipt UIs (built by others) can read/write. Build the endpoints even though this repo does not build those UIs.
